# Stacked Modals — a "+" button starts a chain of 7 alert-like modals; each Confirm/Dismiss stacks the next one on top (older ones spring back, shrink and fade); the last one's Dismiss removes only itself; tapping the backdrop clears the whole stack with staggered FadeOutDown.
# What this test covers: the full 7-modal chain alternating Confirm/Dismiss (titles asserted), "You can dismiss me"
# removing only itself (the 6th resurfaces), continuing from the resurfaced modal (the 7th comes back from the
# memoized node cache), clearing everything via the backdrop, restarting the chain (cached nodes remount), fast
# taps that stack modals while the springs are mid-flight, and a final backdrop clear.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/stacked-modals"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 800
press 330 794
wait "text" "Modals are fun!" 3000
wait 500
press "text=\"Confirm\""
wait "text" "Stacked Modals are really fun!" 3000
wait 500
press "text=\"Dismiss\""
wait "text" "Wait what?" 3000
wait 500
press "text=\"Confirm\""
wait "text" "Are you sure?" 3000
wait 500
press "text=\"Dismiss\""
wait "text" "Ok, you win." 3000
wait 500
press "text=\"Confirm\""
wait "text" "...the past is always with you." 3000
wait 500
press "text=\"Confirm\""
wait "text" "You can dismiss me" 3000
wait 500
# Dismiss on the last one removes only itself.
press "text=\"Dismiss\""
wait 1000
wait "text" "...the past is always with you." 3000
# Continue from the resurfaced 6th: the 7th comes back.
press "text=\"Confirm\""
wait "text" "You can dismiss me" 3000
wait 600
# Clear everything through the backdrop.
press 200 200
wait 1500
# Restart the chain (cached nodes remount) and stack fast while springs run.
press 330 794
wait "text" "Modals are fun!" 3000
press 310 509
wait 150
press 310 509
wait 150
press 231 509
wait 150
press 310 509
wait 1200
# Backdrop clears the whole stack (staggered exits).
press 200 760
wait 1500
# Open and clear immediately.
press 330 794
wait 200
press 200 200
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
